MenoMorph AI — Changing skin. More confident choices.

MenoMorph AI is a menopause-aware skincare discovery prototype that connects
YouCam Skin Analysis with explainable product screening, routine suggestions,
and a selected-product basket.

Users upload a selfie for analysis, review available skin metrics, and explore
a demonstration skincare catalog. MenoMorph applies transparent prototype
rules to flag products for review and explains which ingredients matched its
watchlist.

The application groups products into morning and evening suggestions, allows
users to add and remove catalog items, and displays the selected total. A
wellness logger captures self-reported hot flashes, sleep quality, and
observations alongside a snapshot of current skin metrics.

The interface is designed for desktop and mobile browsers.

YouCam Integration

MenoMorph uses the YouCam Skin Analysis API through a server-side Next.js route.
The application initializes an upload, sends the image to the returned upload
destination, creates an analysis task, polls for completion, and maps the
returned results into the dashboard.

Available concern masks can also be displayed over the uploaded image to
help explain the analysis visually.

The API credential stays on the server.

Prototype Scope

This submission demonstrates skin analysis, explainable product screening,
routine suggestions, and product selection. Product data and rule thresholds
are illustrative. Virtual try-on, payments, and live retailer checkout are
not implemented.

MenoMorph is not a medical diagnostic tool. Its screening rules are not
clinically validated and do not establish medical contraindications or
guarantee that a product is safe for an individual.